    <participant id="Id_c6467aa9-25b2-4168-aa7a-571dbf80bd66" name="Processo de Obras Públicas - FNDE/MEC e Municípios - P23. Encerrar Contrato de Obra" processRef="Id_82a7b649-d84a-434e-aeb4-9d82a4f6c14e">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Processo de an&amp;aacute;lise da conclus&amp;atilde;o da obra contemplando a informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do avan&amp;ccedil;o f&amp;iacute;sico considerando a sinergia entre as atividades diversas dos munic&amp;iacute;pios e da Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133/2021 - Lei de Licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e Contrados Administrativos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
